Z||000005||Tom88gt||07-05-2001||09:18 PM||||The ECM will remember all detected malfunctions no matter how brief or intermittent.  After 50 (I think) ignition key cycles the ECM will clear itself if the malfunction is not detected again.<P>A momentary, intermittent or constant "Check Engine" light are all the same to the ECM.||||reg||1
